=== agr compress --help ===
Exit code: 0

--- stdout ---
Compress existing plain .cast sessions to .cast.gz.

Shows a preview with the number of sessions, current size and projected
size, then asks for confirmation. Sessions that are currently being
recorded are skipped. Without a TTY nothing is prompted and nothing is
rewritten, use --yes to apply.

EXAMPLES:
    agr compress                    [37mPreview and ask for confirmation[0m
    agr compress --agent claude     [37mOnly compress Claude sessions[0m
    agr compress --yes              [37mCompress without confirmation[0m

Usage: agr compress [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --agent <AGENT>
          Only compress sessions from this agent

  -y, --yes
          Skip confirmation prompt

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
